{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的主叙述压缩得较多，人物为什么从一种心境转向另一种心境、前后心理如何衔接，不如X交代得完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点句有明确的视觉锚点，感受又按音乐进程出现，不必一次面对整堆文字，观众更容易边听边抓住人物当下的状态；尤其音乐性的细节、身体感受和情绪转折，比X具体细腻。X的优势是叙述更完整，尤其从不服气、怀念、孤独到重新决定生活的心理因果交代得更充分，Y有些地方需要观众自己补上中间环节。总体而言，Y更能让人同时感受到人物和音乐的细微变化，但X的故事解释与连续性更扎实。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "99bed183-c3cf-4291-b6f8-bb03f15192f3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T133542791856Z", "elapsed_seconds": 123.063, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T13:37:45.870487+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "337bcc63008d29fa0f2da28e2be3ef75ceb42825ed74391d0f6e622bef14021e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g